First, since Raymond was born 6 years before Samantha, that means Raymond is 6 years older than Samantha. 

Now, Samantha is 31 years old now. So, Raymond must be 31 + 6 = 37 years old. 

Raymond had a son when he was 23 years old. So, the son's birth year is Raymond's birth year plus 23 years. 

To find out how many years ago the son was born, we need to calculate the difference between Raymond's current age and 23. 

Raymond is 37 now, and he had the son when he was 23. So, 37 - 23 = 14. 

Therefore, the son was born 14 years ago.

