- **Tuesday:** The problem says she wrote $ \frac{2}{5} $ times more articles than on Monday. This means she wrote $ \frac{2}{5} \times 5 = 2 $ additional articles. Hence, she wrote $ 5 + 2 = 7 $ articles on Tuesday.

